<section class="content">
 <p class="eyebrow">ABOUT SUNNAH TOOLS</p><h1>Practical Islamic tools, without the clutter</h1>
 <p>Sunnah Tools is an independently developed website offering free calculators, calendars, planners and trackers for everyday Muslim life. The goal is straightforward: help visitors complete a useful task quickly, on any device, without registration.</p>
 <h2>How we build and check the tools</h2>
 <p>Most calculations run in your browser. Prayer-time features use recognised astronomical methods, including configurable Fajr and Asr conventions; location searches use the GeoNames city directory. Hijri conversions use the Umm al-Qura calendar convention, and money tools explain how entered amounts are calculated.</p>
 <p>We run automated tests for date boundaries, daylight-saving changes, calculation helpers and the generated website. Technical testing does not make a religious calculation a verified fatwa or an official local timetable. We try to state assumptions directly on each tool.</p>
 <h2>Religious dates and financial questions need local guidance</h2>
 <p>Islamic months may begin on different dates due to regional moon sightings. Local mosque prayer timetables may use different parameters or congregation times. Zakat, Fitrana and pilgrimage questions can depend on the user's circumstances and school of thought. We therefore present estimates and link to further references where possible, rather than claiming universal authority.</p>
 <h2>Advertising and editorial independence</h2>
 <p>We plan to fund maintenance through clearly labelled advertising after any necessary account approval and privacy setup. Ads will be separate from calculator controls and will not determine calculation results or religious guidance. We do not offer payment for improved religious results.</p>
 <h2>Corrections and improvements</h2>
 <p>If you find a mathematical error, inaccessible control or unclear religious assumption, you can report it through <a href="https://github.com/omairarshad/sunnah-tools/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">the project issue tracker</a>. Please avoid submitting private financial or health details there. Report the affected tool, expected result, calculation method and a reproducible example.</p>
 <p>Explore the <a href="/guides/prayer-time-methods/">prayer-time methodology guide</a> and <a href="/guides/ramadan-dates-and-timetables/">Ramadan date and timetable guide</a> for a closer look at the limitations of our tools.</p>
